{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015120137244-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015122940\"/><p>女工右手受傷送院。(趙瑞麟攝)</p><p>大圍發生工業意外。今日(15日)早上11時28分，一名女工在車公廟路18號一商場食肆工作期間，右手意外被切肉機夾困，在場人士見狀慌忙報案求助。人員接報到場將事主救出，交救護車送院搶救，肇事原因有待相關部門調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.808772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:38.029657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:07.046036+00:00","content_hash":"4ffe8fa1af4dc53e39b18d16819ecda811742dadfe875b0f31ba5629fc29921d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}